# int_arithmetic_all — all basic integer arithmetic operations
# (README §10.6). Tests add, subtract, multiply, divide on Int64.

IntArithmeticAll is project
IntArithmeticAll module examplesIntArithmeticAll
IntArithmeticAll target console
IntArithmeticAll entry main

examplesIntArithmeticAll is module
examplesIntArithmeticAll path examples.intArithmeticAll
examplesIntArithmeticAll exports main
examplesIntArithmeticAll purpose "Demonstrate all basic integer arithmetic"
examplesIntArithmeticAll invariant "Add, subtract, multiply, divide all work"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memory heap no
main async no
main purpose "Perform all arithmetic operations and print final result"
main invariant "((10 + 5) - 3) * 2 / 2 = 12"

main let okCode immutable ExitCode 0
main let result immutable Int64 12

main do printResult
main return okCode

printResult is call
printResult in main
printResult invokes console.writeIntegerLine
printResult arg value Int64 result
